      "UnitMotion": "SMILE"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 9,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "이상한 여자에게 이끌려 다른 세계에 떨어진 것만도 이미 충분히 힘들다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "知らない女性に導かれて異世界に来ただけでもびっくりなのに…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 10,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "사정 따윈 모르겠고 갑자기 유부남이 되는 걸 받아들일 수 있겠냐?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "いきなり子持ちになるなんて、想定外だ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 11,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "CameraOffsetTime": "FA",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "쾌락 없는 책임은 단호히 거부한다!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "身に覚えのない責任なんて、誰が背負えるものか…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 12,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_STARPIERCER_OMEGA",
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_UNKNOWN"
      ],
      "CameraOffsetTime": "FA",
      "UnitMotion": "ANGRY",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "악마 아니야, 아빠! 오메가야!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "違わないもん、パパ！オメガだよ！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_7_UNIT_S_STARPIERCER_OMEGA_003.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 13,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_STARPIERCER_OMEGA",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "오메가, 엄청 오래 잤어! 엄청 오래 기다렸어!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "オメガ、ずーっと眠っていたの！ずーっと待っていたの！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_7_UNIT_S_STARPIERCER_OMEGA_004.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 14,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_STARPIERCER_OMEGA",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "FA",
      "UnitMotion": "USN_UI_TOUCH",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "잘했지? 잘했지? 오메가 착한 딸이지?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "えらい？えらいでしょ？オメガ、いい子だよね？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_7_UNIT_S_STARPIERCER_OMEGA_005.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 15,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_STARPIERCER_OMEGA",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그럼 이제 오메가 나가도 돼? 나가서 놀아도 돼?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "オメガ、もう外に出てもいい？外で遊んでもいい？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_7_UNIT_S_STARPIERCER_OMEGA_006.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 16,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "아빠 아니라니까…!",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "だからパパじゃないってば…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 17,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_STARPIERCER_OMEGA",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "FA",
      "UnitMotion": "USN_UI_REST_START",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…정말로 아니야?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ほんとに違うの？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_7_UNIT_S_STARPIERCER_OMEGA_007.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 18,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_STARPIERCER_OMEGA",
      "UnitMotion": "SAD",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "이상하네… 분명 아빠 냄새가 나는데…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "おかしいな…確かにパパの匂いがするのに…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_7_UNIT_S_STARPIERCER_OMEGA_008.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 19,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "소녀는 잠시 실망한 듯 슬픈 표정이 되었다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "少女はガッカリしたように、悲しい表情をした。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 20,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "약간의 죄책감이 든다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "私は少し罪悪感を抱いた。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 21,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "하지만… 진짜 아빠 아니라고…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "でも…私は本当にパパじゃないんだ…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 22,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_STARPIERCER_OMEGA",
      "EmotionEffect": "STRESS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그렇구나…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "そっか…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_7_UNIT_S_STARPIERCER_OMEGA_009.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 23,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_STARPIERCER_OMEGA",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "NR",
      "UnitMotion": "USN_UI_REST_START",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그럼 오메가, 다시 잘게.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "じゃあオメガ、また寝るね。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_7_UNIT_S_STARPIERCER_OMEGA_010.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 24,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_STARPIERCER_OMEGA",
      "UnitMotion": "SAD",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "안녕히 주무세요…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "おやすみなさい…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP3_7_UNIT_S_STARPIERCER_OMEGA_011.wav"
    },
    {
